  "description": "At some point, the gaze of his nephew, whom he had always thought was young, began to feel strange. In his dream, Seok-In became sexually aware of his nephew for the first time when Han touched him. However, Seok-In pretended not to notice Han's gaze because he did not want to lose his only family...\n\n*\"Uncle, you brought this on yourself.\"*\n\nThat is how his relationship with his nephew began to go wrong.\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
